Imported 8 October 2026.

The complete upstream source tree, including its dependency lock and development
metadata, is unmodified. Its provenance is recorded in ../pillama.upstream.json.
Source releases contain that complete tree; installed packages contain only
the upstream package's declared runtime files plus this notice. BashKitten's
separate pillama.ts adapter selects the built-in llama.cpp or managed
bashkitten-llama provider; the web UI displays pillama's native RPC status text.
